OL,3,GNEWSAExeter City condemns 'shameful
OL,4,Abehaviour' of fans
OL,5,
OL,6,FExeter City has condemned the "shameful
OL,7,Fbehaviour" of fans following reports of
OL,8,Fmisogynistic chanting during the Devon
OL,9,Fderby and an allegation of sexual
OL,10,Fharassment after a match.
OL,12,FThe club said it was extremely
OL,13,Fdisappointed to report 15 seats were
OL,14,Fdamaged during its League Cup clash
OL,15,Faway at Plymouth Argyle on 10 August,
OL,16,Fwith a lighter also thrown on the
OL,17,Fpitch.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
