OL,3,GNEWSAExeter City condemns 'shameful
OL,4,Abehaviour' of fans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree Exeter City supporters were also
OL,7,Farrested during the match while five
OL,8,Findividuals - four of whom were under
OL,9,F18 - were banned from attending games
OL,10,Fat St James Park.
OL,12,FIn a statement, the League Two club
OL,13,Fsaid those responsible were "not true
OL,14,Fsupporters". The BBC has contacted
OL,15,FDevon and Cornwall Police for more
OL,16,Finformation.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
